 "text": "Hi, how have things been? Going straight from work travel to holiday can be tough. I'd lean towards waiting at least a few months. That works well. A simple hi how are you works when you pop in for groceries. You could be here in an hour if you want. The owner might get suspicious. That's fine. Short, frequent visits with clear reasons work better than one big one. That's a reasonable plan. Cafe is a good spot to spot you. Owners usually appreciate your warning. Then wait until the spring vacation. Lockdowns ease, and you' still have time for summer travel.",
